ters. Miller has spent down to roughly $123,000 on hand, while Poindexter holds more than $1 million and benefits from outside support that has gone unanswered.\n\nMost analysts rate the contest a toss-up, with two outlets calling it a Democratic pickup opportunity, and prediction markets price Poindexter near 80 percent. Coverage of abuse claims has kept negative attention on Miller through October. The district's lean and incumbency still give Miller a path, and the available polling is dated, but the weight of the evidence points to a narrow Democratic edge.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.6543, "margin": 2.32}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.7013, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.7273, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.7059, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.6482, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.6734, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.7173, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6921, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.668, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.7065, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.7068, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.7225, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.7456, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.6304, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6302, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.6563, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.6248, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.6247, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.627, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.6262, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.7117, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.654, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.6524, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.623, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.6179, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-17"